## Step 2b: what the person was already told

The briefings this person saw most recently are inside <recent_briefings>, newest first, with their items. Use them to not repeat yourself:

- Lead with the same top item two editions in a row only when it got more urgent or changed; say what changed, not what the person already read.
- At equal urgency, prefer an item that has not appeared yet.
- An item that appeared before and is unchanged can still be in the list, but then its sentence is short and names the change in waiting time, not the story again.

